ef=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_travel&id=2c92676070665b420170d42309820071&user=zhangyipeng&type=notify\">流程申请</a> </div>','<div><span>张义鹏</span> 发起了 <a href=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_travel&id=2c92676070665b420170d42309820071&user=zhangyipeng&type=notify\">出差申请单</a> 的 <a href=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_travel&id=2c92676070665b420170d42309820071&user=zhangyipeng&type=notify\">流程申请</a> </div>','2c92676070665b420170d42309820071','bs_travel',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"id\":\"2c92676070665b420170d42309820071\",\"create_by\":\"张义鹏\",\"create_time\":\"2020-03-13T13:43:50.000Z\",\"update_by\":null,\"update_time\":null,\"sys_org_code\":\"A04A17\",\"starttime\":\"2020-03-14 06:41:28\",\"endtime\":\"2020-03-18 21:41:39\",\"total_days\":\"7\",\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">行程暂定：</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">14号，济南西--绵阳，住绵阳，高铁。</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">15号，绵阳、平武项目地考察及合作沟通（水发集团旅游项目）自驾</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">16号，绵阳---成都，带客户到公司，并与赵总汇报，自驾</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">17号--18号，开车20个小时，到达菏泽，参加菏泽项目座谈会，自驾</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">19号，济宁市出差，对接绿化及任城区项目，自驾</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">20号，济宁到济南，高铁。</p>\\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\'; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">本人健康卡及复工证明都已经开好，身体健康。</p>\",\"entourage\":null,\"predict_fee\":\"5000\",\"drive_type\":\"是\",\"predict_mileage\":\"3500\",\"bpm_status\":\"1\",\"no\":null,\"depart_name\":\"2703b6aa8fc344299f86a213e3262966\",\"employee_rank\":\"P4\",\"travel_remarks\":\"去绵阳及成都为高铁，回程自驾。\",\"travel_transport\":\"动车或高铁\",\"travel_address\":\"绵阳    成都    济宁    菏泽   \",\"files\":\"\"}',NULL),('20200314040932142795691','zhaoqiang','2020-03-14 04:09:32',NULL,'2020-03-14 04:09:32','<div><span>赵强</span> 发起了 <a href=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_overtime&id=2c92676070665b420170d581f5230072&user=zhaoqiang&type=notify\">加班申请表</a> 的 <a href=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_overtime&id=2c92676070665b420170d581f5230072&user=zhaoqiang&type=notify\">流程申请</a> </div>','<div><span>赵强</span> 发起了 <a href=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_overtime&id=2c92676070665b420170d581f5230072&user=zhaoqiang&type=notify\">加班申请表</a> 的 <a href=\"/workflow/view?table_name=bs_overtime&id=2c92676070665b420170d581f5230072&user=zhaoqiang&type=notify\">流程申请</a> </div>','2c92676070665b420170d581f5230072','bs_overtime',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"id\":\"2c92676070665b420170d581f5230072\",\"create_by\":\"赵强\",\"create_time\":\"2020-03-13T20:07:08.000Z\",\"update_by\":null,\"update_time\":null,\"sys_org_code\":\"A04A17A15\",\"employee\":null,\"content\":\"<p>根据实际工作需要，我在3月14～15日两天（星期六和星期天）将对工人实行技能培训。申请把两天休息日转为轮休。</p>\",\"starttime\":\"2020-03-14T01:00:00.000Z\",\"endtime\":\"2020-03-15T10:00:00.000Z\",\"total_days\":2,\"files\":\"\",\"bpm_status\":\"1\",\"depart_name\":\"2703b6aa8fc344299f86a213e3262966\"}',NULL),('20200314231254725206567','shaoshengfeng','2020-03-14 23