 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\\\\\">（4）组织变革PBC考核评分人与权重调整相关岗位需按方案调整执行，区域人力组织自行检查，总部进行专项抽查，不合规项目按《2020年人力资源体系积分管理方案》予以扣分，1分/项。</span></p>\\\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\\\n<p><span class=\\\\\\\"titleSpan\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\\\\\">2、请蓝光生命科技集团、现代服务业集团根据自身制度规定开展2020年一季度个人绩效考核。</span></p>\\\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\\\n<p><span class=\\\\\\\"titleSpan\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\\\\\">特此通知！</span></p>\\\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\\",\\\"operate_time\\\":\\\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\\\",\\\"create_time\\\":\\\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\\\",\\\"business_data\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"LNR5WUYOVPZQRCMKODXKG1QS4K31QJHQ\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"create_by\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"zhaoziyu\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"create_time\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"table_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"bs_announce\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"main_key\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"audit_node\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"approve_node\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"zhaoziyu\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"notify_node\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"}\\\"}\",\"approve_user\":\"zhaoziyu\",\"process_audit\":\"000000000\",\"create_time\":\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\",\"relate_data\":null,\"origin_data\":null}]}','{\"operation\":\"patch\",\"tableName\":\"bs_announce\",\"id\":\"2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060\",\"data\":{\"bpm_status\":\"4\"}}','{\"opeartion\":\"add\",\"tableName\":\"\",\"data\":\"\"}','{\"opeartion\":\"add\",\"tableName\":\"\",\"data\":\"\"}','{}','wait',0,'bs_announce','{\"id\":\"2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060\",\"create_by\":\"zhaoziyu\",\"create_time\":\"2020-03-11 11:59:14\",\"update_by\":\"zhaoziyu\",\"update_time\":\"2020-03-11T03:59:47.000Z\",\"files\":\"files/20200311115900501_蓝光集团年第一季度PBC绩效考核.pdf\",\"bpm_status\":\"2\",\"depart_name\":\"上级单位\",\"announce_type\":\"行政公告\",\"announce_item\":null,\"announce_title\":\"[蓝光发展]关于2020年第一季度度个人绩效PBC考核工作安排的通知\",\"announce_zone\":null,\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">&nbsp; </span><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">关于2020年第一季度度个人绩效PBC考核工作安排的通知</span></h1>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">各中心、各业务单位：</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">现就一季度个人绩效PBC考核相关工作安排如下，请各单位参考节点组织落实，各单位可根据自身实际情况安排具体计划，节点完成日期不得晚于下表要求。内容如下：</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">最晚完成日期</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">员工完成个人PBC表单评分人、权重、目标设置 </span><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">3月15日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">上级完成PBC表审核确认&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3月18日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">完成一季度PBC员工自评、上级评分&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">4月06日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">确认一季度参与考核排名人员名单&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4月06日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">完成一季度PBC考核结果强排&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4月10日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">完成个人绩效PRR沟通&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4月15日</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">1、请各单位人力资源相关人员在执行过程中关注如下重点环节，发现问题及时与总部沟通。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（1）所有员工须参照《各类员工绩效考核操作标准》严格执行。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（2）认真检查考核期内新聘、离职、病产孕、强管控管理体系人员、调动借调人员是否参与考核和排名、考核人和参与排名的单位是否正确，重点关注异动人员并与异动涉及单位人力资源部门沟通，防止错漏。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（3）强管控体系区域人员由总部职能部门统一排名，包括：审计、法务、财务、招采职能相关人员。请总部职能部门加强与区域的沟通，重点确认纳入总部绩效排名的人员名单，防止错漏。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（4）组织变革PBC考核评分人与权重调整相关岗位需按方案调整执行，区域人力组织自行检查，总部进行专项抽查，不合规项目按《2020年人力资源体系积分管理方案》予以扣分，1分/项。</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">2、请蓝光生命科技集团、现代服务业集团根据自身制度规定开展2020年一季度个人绩效考核。</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">特此通知！</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"bpm_status_name\":\"审核中\",\"starttime\":\"2020-03-11 11:59:14\",\"endtime\":\"--\",\"startTimeName\":\"开始\",\"endTimeName\":\"结束\",\"fileNameTitle\":\"文件名称\",\"fieldName\":{},\"fileStatus\":0,\"fileType\":\"@office@\",\"fileURL\":\"https://www.shengtai.club/jeecg-boot/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.shengtai.club%2Ffiles%2Fconvert%2F20200311115900501_%E8%93%9D%E5%85%89%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AD%A3%E5%BA%A6PBC%E7%BB%A9%E6%95%88%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8.pdf\",\"officeList\":[{\"title\":\"文档\",\"src\":\"https://www.shengtai.club/jeecg-boot/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.shengtai.club%2Ffiles%2Fconvert%2F20200311115900501_%E8%93%9D%E5%85%89%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AD%A3%E5%BA%A6PBC%E7%BB%A9%E6%95%88%E8%80%83%E6%A0%B8.pdf\",\"file\":\"https://www.shengtai.club/files/convert/20200311115900501_蓝光集团年第一季度PBC绩效考核.pdf\",\"msrc\":\"https://www.shengtai.club/files/20200311115900501_蓝光集团年第一季度PBC绩效考核.pdf\",\"name\":\"20200311115900501_蓝光集团年第一季度pbc绩效考核.pdf\"}]}','2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060'),('F5U3N6WGC1MXC9CD8DZ767BERSUX9MDQ','hehuan','2020-03-10 16:28:53','next','{\"opeartion\":\"add\",\"tableName\":\"PR_LOG\",\"data\":{\"id\":\"MX4VFM364FRZ5YZ9VO1KHEGBJEOTYAND\",\"table_name\":\"bs_seal_normal\",\"main_value\":\"2c92676070665b420170be6351e5004f\",\"business_data_id\":\"2c92676070665b420170be6351e5004f\",\"business_code\":\"000000000\",\"process_name\":\"自由流程审批\",\"employee\":\"shaoshengfeng\",\"process_station\":\"自由流程审批\",\"process_audit\":\"000000000\",\"proponents\":\"chenxuxu\",\"content\":\"<p>离职证明(胡萍)</p>\",\"operate_time\":\"2020-03-10 16:28:53\",\"create_time\":\"2020-03-10 16:28:53\",\"business_data\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"D5RL8KAL3G1EHSLTEE9MI11HZGPYOJ77\\\",\\\"table_name\\\":\\\"bs_seal_normal\\\",\\\"main_value\\\":\\\"2c92676070665b420170be6351e5004f\\\",\\\"business_data_id\\\":\\\"2c92676070665b420170be6351e5004f\\\",\\\"business_code\\\":\\\"000000000\\\",\\\"process_name\\\":\\\"自由流程审批\\\",\\\"employee\\\":\\\"chenxuxu\\\",\\\"process_station\\\":\\\"自由流程审批\\\",\\\"process_audit\\\":\\\"000000000\\\",\\\"proponents\\\":\\\"chenxuxu\\\",\\\"approve_user\\\":\\\"chenxuxu\\\",\\\"action\\\":\\\"发起\\\",\\\"action_opinion\\\":\\\"发起自由流程\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<p>离职证明(胡萍)</p>\\\",\\\"operate_time\\\":\\\"2020-03-09 16:22:53\\\",\\\"create_time\\\":\\\"2020-03-09 16:22:53\\\",\\\"business_data\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"PKP1PYC81OP7WZI6VCP15T2KU9IXPXJP\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"create_by\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"chenxuxu\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"create_time\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2020-03-09 16: