lue\":\"2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060\",\"business_data_id\":\"2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060\",\"business_code\":\"000000000\",\"process_name\":\"自由流程审批\",\"employee\":\"zhaoziyu\",\"process_station\":\"自由流程审批\",\"process_audit\":\"000000000\",\"proponents\":\"zhaoziyu\",\"approve_user\":\"zhaoziyu\",\"action\":\"发起\",\"action_opinion\":\"发起自由流程\",\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">&nbsp; </span><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">关于2020年第一季度度个人绩效PBC考核工作安排的通知</span></h1>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">各中心、各业务单位：</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">现就一季度个人绩效PBC考核相关工作安排如下，请各单位参考节点组织落实，各单位可根据自身实际情况安排具体计划，节点完成日期不得晚于下表要求。内容如下：</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">最晚完成日期</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">员工完成个人PBC表单评分人、权重、目标设置 </span><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">3月15日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">上级完成PBC表审核确认&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3月18日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">完成一季度PBC员工自评、上级评分&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">4月06日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">确认一季度参与考核排名人员名单&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4月06日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">完成一季度PBC考核结果强排&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4月10日</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">完成个人绩效PRR沟通&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4月15日</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">1、请各单位人力资源相关人员在执行过程中关注如下重点环节，发现问题及时与总部沟通。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（1）所有员工须参照《各类员工绩效考核操作标准》严格执行。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（2）认真检查考核期内新聘、离职、病产孕、强管控管理体系人员、调动借调人员是否参与考核和排名、考核人和参与排名的单位是否正确，重点关注异动人员并与异动涉及单位人力资源部门沟通，防止错漏。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（3）强管控体系区域人员由总部职能部门统一排名，包括：审计、法务、财务、招采职能相关人员。请总部职能部门加强与区域的沟通，重点确认纳入总部绩效排名的人员名单，防止错漏。</span></p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">（4）组织变革PBC考核评分人与权重调整相关岗位需按方案调整执行，区域人力组织自行检查，总部进行专项抽查，不合规项目按《2020年人力资源体系积分管理方案》予以扣分，1分/项。</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">2、请蓝光生命科技集团、现代服务业集团根据自身制度规定开展2020年一季度个人绩效考核。</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p><span class=\\\"titleSpan\\\" style=\\\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">特此通知！</span></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"operate_time\":\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\",\"create_time\":\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\",\"business_data\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"LNR5WUYOVPZQRCMKODXKG1QS4K31QJHQ\\\",\\\"create_by\\\":\\\"zhaoziyu\\\",\\\"create_time\\\":\\\"2020-03-11 12:00:01\\\",\\\"table_name\\\":\\\"bs_announce\\\",\\\"main_key\\\":\\\"2c92676070665b420170c7bf17380060\\\",\\\"audit_node\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"approve_node\\\":\\\"zhaoziyu\\\",\\\"notify_node\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}','<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp; </span><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">关于2020年第一季度度个人绩效PBC考核工作安排的通知</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">各中心、各业务单位：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">现就一季度个人绩效PBC考核相关工作安排如下，请各单位参考节点组织落实，各单位可根据自身实际情况安排具体计划，节点完成日期不得晚于下表要求。内容如下：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">最晚完成日期</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">员工完成个人PBC表单评分人、权重、目标设置 </span><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">3月15日</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">上级完成PBC表审核确认&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3月18日</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">完成一季度PBC员工自评、上级评分&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">4月06日</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">确认一季度参与考核排名人员名单&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4月06日</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">完成一季度PBC考核结果强排&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4月10日</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">完成个人绩效PRR沟通&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4月15日</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">1、请各单位人力资源相关人员在执行过程中关注如下重点环节，发现问题及时与总部沟通。</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">（1）所有员工须参照《各类员工绩效考核操作标准》严格执行。</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">（2）认真检查考核期内新聘、离职、病产孕、强管控管理体系人员、调动借调人员是否参与考核和排名、考核人和参与排名的单位是否正确，重点关注异动人员并与异动涉及单位人力资源部门沟通，防止错漏。</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">（3）强管控体系区域人员由总部职能部门统一排名，包括：审计、法务、财务、招采职能相关人员。请总部职能部门加强与区域的沟通，重点确认纳入总部绩效排名的人员名单，防止错漏。</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">（4）组织变革PBC考核评分人与权重调整相关岗位需按方案调整执行，区域人力组织自行检查，总部进行专项抽查，不合规项目按《2020年人力资源体系积分管理方案》予以扣分，1分/项。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">2、请蓝光生命科技集团、现代服务业集团根据自身制度规定开展2020年一季度个人绩效考核。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"titleSpan\" style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体, Arial, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; background-color: #ffffff;\">特此通知！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','000000000','2020-03-11 12:00:01',NULL,NULL),('RN851T6E78NKHJ79QK14RX5BECVNDMPZ','bs_egress','2c9267606fc35022016ffab230fd000f','hubo','2c9267606fc35022016ffab230fd000f','000000000','自由流程审批','luowei','luowei','同意','同意','2020-02-01 19:56:55',NULL,'自由流程审批','{\"id\":\"PPK21JGL59FCSEC8RFU365KBS9DFSLPU\",\"table_name\":\"bs_egress\",\"main_value\":\"2c9267606fc35022016ffab230fd000f\",\"business_data_id\":\"2c9267606fc35022016ffab230fd000f\",\"business_code\":\"000000000\",\"process_name\":\"自由流程审批\",\"employee\":\"hubo\",\"process_station\":\"自由流程审批\",\"process_audit\":\"000000000\",\"proponents\":\"hubo\",\"approve_user\":\"hubo\",\"action\":\"发起\",\"action_opinion\":\"发起自由流程\",\"content\":\"<p>BIM技术调研</p>\",\"operate_time\":\"2020-01-31 16:23:18\",\"create_time\":\"2020-01-31 16:23:18\",\"business_data\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"Q8ESZ1IJW9TECQEE9L6HZOU6VPRI88W1\\\",\\\"create_by\\\":\\\"hubo\\\",\\\"create_time\\\":\\\"2020-01-31 16:23:18\\\",\\\"table_name\\\":\\\"bs_egress\\\",\\\"main_key\\\":